      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Doorstep Delivery Handover, Inventory Verification &amp; Placement at Jaipur</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>At the Jaipur site the final delivery and uncrating protocol is executed in a systematic, daylight‑driven sequence that guarantees every item matches the original inventory bilty, functions correctly, is positioned cleanly, and leaves the space free of any packing waste.</p>

<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Daylight Verification Against Inventory Bilty:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">As soon as the truck is positioned, the receiving team opens the doors under natural light to compare each box, crate, and pallet with the detailed inventory bilty. The bilty number, description, quantity, and serial numbers are cross‑checked on a portable tablet, and any discrepancy is recorded immediately for corrective action.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Physical Inspection for Damage:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">While the items are still illuminated by daylight, the crew inspects surfaces, corners, and seals for dents, scratches, or broken seals. Photographs are taken for documentation, and damaged pieces are isolated for claim processing.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<p>Once verification is complete, the team proceeds to functional testing of all electrical and mechanical components before they are moved to their final locations.</p>

<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Electrical Testing:</strong> Power cables are connected to a temporary circuit, voltage and continuity are measured with a calibrated multimeter, and each device is powered on to confirm indicator lights, displays, and safety features operate as specified.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Mechanical Testing:</strong> Moving parts such as motors, hinges, and adjustable mechanisms are exercised through their full range of motion. Load tests are performed where applicable, and any abnormal noise or resistance is logged for service.</span></li>
</ul>

<p>After successful testing, the clean furniture placement phase begins. The crew follows a pre‑approved layout plan, ensuring each piece is positioned exactly where it belongs, with protective floor pads and lint‑free cloths used to keep surfaces spotless.</p>

<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Placement Accuracy:</strong> Measurements are taken with laser distance meters to verify alignment with architectural drawings.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Surface Cleaning:</strong> Once in place, each item is wiped down with a neutral‑pH cleaner to remove dust, fingerprints, or residue from packaging.</span></li>
</ul>

<p>The final step is the swift removal of all packing debris, guaranteeing a tidy environment ready for immediate use.</p>

<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Debris Collection:</strong> All boxes, foam, bubble wrap, and protective films are gathered into designated waste containers.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Recycling and Disposal:</strong> Materials are sorted on‑site for recycling where possible; non‑recyclables are sealed for proper disposal according to local regulations.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Final Site Sweep:</strong> A thorough vacuum and mop of the floor completes the process, leaving the area immaculate and safe for occupants.</span></li>
</ul>

<p>This comprehensive protocol ensures that delivery at Jaipur is verified, tested, aesthetically arranged, and left free of clutter, meeting both client expectations and quality‑control standards.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


